Description: MQTT driver for Dauerhaft PRO RS-485 actuators
 This package provides a Wiren Board MQTT driver for Dauerhaft PRO RS-485 blind
 and shutter actuators. It drives the actuators over the RS-485 bus through
 wb-mqtt-serial's port/Load RPC, exposes each one as an MQTT device, and is
 configured via wb-mqtt-confed.
